{"route":"/docs/5.0/content/images/","version":"5.0","renderedVersion":"5.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Images","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Documentation and examples for opting images into responsive behavior (so they never become larger than their parent elements) and add lightweight styles to them—all via classes."},"blocks":[{"id":"responsive-images","type":"heading","en":"Responsive images","level":2},{"id":"responsive-images--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Images in Bootstrap are made responsive with <code>.img-fluid</code>. This applies <code>max-width: 100%;</code> and <code>height: auto;</code> to the image so that it scales with the parent element."},{"id":"responsive-images--example-1","type":"demo","key":"f26dccb21b7ae2f81fdc","height":300},{"id":"responsive-images--code-1","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"...\">","language":"html"},{"id":"image-thumbnails","type":"heading","en":"Image thumbnails","level":2},{"id":"image-thumbnails--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"In addition to our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/utilities/borders/\">border-radius utilities</a>, you can use <code>.img-thumbnail</code> to give an image a rounded 1px border appearance."},{"id":"image-thumbnails--example-1","type":"demo","key":"0656900b8bdf15cd078f","height":147},{"id":"image-thumbnails--code-1","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"img-thumbnail\" alt=\"...\">","language":"html"},{"id":"aligning-images","type":"heading","en":"Aligning images","level":2},{"id":"aligning-images--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Align images with the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/utilities/float/\">helper float classes</a> or <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/utilities/text/#text-alignment\">text alignment classes</a>. <code>block</code>-level images can be centered using <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/utilities/spacing/#horizontal-centering\">the <code>.mx-auto</code> margin utility class</a>."},{"id":"aligning-images--example-1","type":"demo","key":"aed078d4533bca2f1e23","height":174},{"id":"aligning-images--code-1","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"rounded float-start\" alt=\"...\">\n<img src=\"...\" class=\"rounded float-end\" alt=\"...\">","language":"html"},{"id":"aligning-images--example-2","type":"demo","key":"b982f09d50888b15fb3d","height":147},{"id":"aligning-images--code-2","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"rounded mx-auto d-block\" alt=\"...\">","language":"html"},{"id":"aligning-images--example-3","type":"demo","key":"d9570b1c2833b9213159","height":147},{"id":"aligning-images--code-3","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"text-center\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"rounded\" alt=\"...\">\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"picture","type":"heading","en":"Picture","level":2},{"id":"picture--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"If you are using the <code>&lt;picture&gt;</code> element to specify multiple <code>&lt;source&gt;</code> elements for a specific <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>, make sure to add the <code>.img-*</code> classes to the <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> and not to the <code>&lt;picture&gt;</code> tag."},{"id":"picture--code-1","type":"code","value":"<picture>\n  <source srcset=\"...\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" alt=\"...\">\n</picture>","language":"html"},{"id":"sass","type":"heading","en":"Sass","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Variables are available for image thumbnails."},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"$thumbnail-padding:                 .25rem;\n$thumbnail-bg:                      $body-bg;\n$thumbnail-border-width:            $border-width;\n$thumbnail-border-color:            $gray-300;\n$thumbnail-border-radius:           $border-radius;\n$thumbnail-box-shadow:              $box-shadow-sm;","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"f26dccb21b7ae2f81fdc","html":"\n<svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img bd-placeholder-img-lg img-fluid\" width=\"100%\" height=\"250\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder: Responsive image\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#868e96\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">Responsive image</text></svg>\n\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"0656900b8bdf15cd078f","html":"\n<svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img img-thumbnail\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A generic square placeholder image with a white border around it, making it resemble a photograph taken with an old instant camera: 200x200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\"><title>A generic square placeholder image with a white border around it, making it resemble a photograph taken with an old instant camera</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#868e96\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">200x200</text></svg>\n\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"aed078d4533bca2f1e23","html":"\n<svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img rounded float-start\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder: 200x200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#868e96\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">200x200</text></svg>\n\n<svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img rounded float-end\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder: 200x200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#868e96\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">200x200</text></svg>\n\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"b982f09d50888b15fb3d","html":"\n<svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img rounded mx-auto d-block\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder: 200x200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#868e96\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">200x200</text></svg>\n\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"d9570b1c2833b9213159","html":"\n<div class=\"text-center\">\n  <svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img rounded\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder: 200x200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#868e96\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">200x200</text></svg>\n\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Build tools","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/build-tools/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/parcel/"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/accessibility/"},{"en":"RFS","href":"https://get